0:00:03.040,0:00:08.480
﻿Electricity is normally invisible. But 
what if you could literally see the current

0:00:08.480,0:00:14.697
flowing through a low-voltage distribution 
board?

0:00:14.697,0:00:24.240
With this mixed reality training, the operation of a low-voltage distribution 
board becomes visible and easy to understand.

0:00:24.240,0:00:29.280
Users see how electricity flows through the board 
and how different components and circuits affect

0:00:29.280,0:00:35.760
the power supply. This gives them insight into how 
the different parts work together. Additionally,

0:00:35.760,0:00:41.120
users can select and enlarge individual 
components to examine them up close. With

0:00:41.120,0:00:49.280
spoken explanations, they discover how each part 
works and what function it has. The trainer also

0:00:49.280,0:00:53.040
stays involved. Through Spherio, they 
can see live what the trainee sees,

0:00:53.760,0:00:58.560
making immediate guidance and 
support possible. In this way,

0:00:58.560,0:01:03.680
mixed reality makes the invisible visible and 
makes learning more interactive than ever.
